## 8. Performance Metrics Reported

The following metrics are useful to report for each test scenario:

| Metric | Unit | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| First input cycle | Cycles | Beginning of execution |
| Last output cycle | Cycles | Completion of execution |
| Measured latency | Cycles | End-to-end execution duration |
| Execution time | ns | Latency at the assumed clock period |
| Expected MAC operations | MACs | Workload size |
| Observed valid MAC events | Events | Verification of output activity |
| Average throughput | MACs/cycle | Average processing rate |
| Average throughput | MAC/s | Processing rate at the assumed frequency |

For the architecture comparison, report both the single-transaction and back-to-back results.

